@startuml "Monitoring de sécurité"

title Monitoring de sécurité

participant "API Gateway\n(Next.js API)" as API
participant "Cache Layer\n(Redis)" as Cache
participant "Rate Limiter\n(Redis)" as RateLimit
participant "Monitoring\n(Prometheus)" as Monitoring
participant "Logging\n(Winston)" as Logging

API -> API: Detect suspicious activity
API -> Logging: Log security event
API -> Cache: INCR security_incidents:{ip}
API -> Monitoring: Alert security team

alt Threshold exceeded
    API -> Cache: SET blocked_ip:{ip} = true (TTL: 1h)
    API -> RateLimit: Block future requests
end

@enduml